And for what?

313
00:20:41,170 --> 00:20:43,550
Well, I guess I did help those people.

314
00:20:45,030 --> 00:20:47,510
And nothing I ever did felt so good.

315
00:20:54,410 --> 00:20:55,410
I guess...

316
